	(text "Most LIPO charging chips use current detection to end charging, since the battery will draw very little current when it's at full voltage. If the system load is also connected to that pin, it can throw that sensing out of wack since the current draw isn't only from the battery anymore.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
